metadata/what = "The Watchstone: the Lookout's crag and its timber walkways, built to Ramon's sheet (PenLayout/PLAN_REF_LOCK.md). The big rock chunks are under Chunks: move, turn or resize them."

[node name="Chunks" type="Node4D" parent="."]
